47493275, -0.0021156257, 0.008483933, -0.002937463, 0.0074382303, 0.023199946, -0.021551464, 0.0060864687, -0.0068484545, 0.006246992, -0.048954275, -0.0058434564, -0.04677788, 0.04750408, 0.057101674, -0.004354737, -0.0031479853, 0.0022286403, 0.030917995, 0.018813506, 0.09728312, -0.049204398, 0.058823466, 0.025848359, -0.08821768, 0.0065523223, -0.057605978, -0.019718837, 0.097022615, -0.021691723, 0.034114193, 0.04657908, 0.018768387, 0.018623533, 0.0072580515, 0.017923757, -0.004189562, 0.0008194325, -0.031852532, -0.022571221, -0.002492658, 0.03194691, 0.03930714, 0.037270673, -0.037869535, 0.008804857, 0.019730551, 0.050787296, 0.00606626, 0.043705024, 2.1294278e-34, 0.004516925, -0.08212791, -0.028260514, 0.014167734, -0.01596218, -0.019210707, 0.0252725, 0.036259413, -0.0016723091, -0.043077286, -0.0099415975], embedding_text: 'Policy: Expense Reimbursement Policy\nVersion: None\nID: POLICY-FIN-005\n\nContent:\n# Expense Reimbursement Policy\n\n**Document ID**: POLICY-FIN-005  \n**Version**: 1.3  \n**Effective Date**: March 1, 2024  \n**Owner**: CFO Office (Raj Patel)  \n**Last Updated**: March 1, 2024  \n**Review Frequency**: Annually  \n**Confidentiality**: Internal\n\n---\n\n## 1. Purpose\n\nThis policy establishes guidelines for employee expense reimbursement to ensure:\n- Fair compensation for business expenses\n- Timely reimbursement\n- Proper documentation and compliance\n- Prevention of fraud\n\n---\n\n## 2. Scope\n\nApplies to all employees who incur business expenses on behalf of NexaTech\n\n---\n\n## 3. General Principles\n\n### 3.1 Business Purpose\n\n**Reimbursable expenses** must be:\n- ✓ Necessary for business operations\n- ✓ Reasonable in amount\n- ✓ Properly documented\n- ✓ Approved in advance (when required)\n\n**Not reimbursable**:\n- ❌ Personal expenses\n- ❌ Commuting to regular office\n- ❌ Expenses covered by other policies (e.g., travel meals covered by per diem)\n\n### 3.2 Employee Responsibility\n\n**You are responsible for**:\n- Spending company money as if it were your own\n- Obtaining proper approvals\n- Submitting expenses promptly\n- Providing accurate documentation\n- Following all policy guidelines\n\n### 3.3 Company Commitment\n\n**We commit to**:\n- Reimburse legitimate expenses fully\n- Process reimbursements within 15 business days\n- Provide clear guidelines\n- Fair and consistent application\n\n---\n\n## 4. Reimbursable Expense Categories\n\n### 4.1 Business Travel\n\n**Covered**: See Travel Expense Policy (POLICY-FIN-004) for details\n- Transportation (air, rail, taxi, rental car)\n- Accommodations\n- Meals (per diem or actual)\n- Ground transportation\n\n**Not covered here** (separate policy applies)\n\n### 4.2 Professional Development\n\n**Covered**: See Professional Development Policy (POLICY-HR-003) for details\n- Conferences and training\n- Professional memberships\n- Books and learning materials\n- Certifications\n\n**Annual budget limits apply**\n\n### 4.3 Home Office Setup\n\n**For remote employees** (one-time):\n- Office furniture: Up to ¥100,000\n- Equipment: Company provides (not reimbursed)\n- Ergonomic accessories: ¥20,000\n\n**See**: Remote Work Policy (POLICY-HR-001)\n\n### 4.4 Home Office Monthly Stipend\n\n**For remote employees** (recurring):\n- ¥5,000/month automatically paid\n- No receipts required\n- Covers: Internet, electricity, phone\n\n### 4.5 Mobile Phone\n\n**If personal phone used for business**:\n- ¥3,000/month stipend (no receipts)\n- Or company-provided phone\n\n**Not both**\n\n### 4.6 Coworking Space\n\n**If remote employee needs occasional workspace**:\n- Up to ¥30,000/month\n- Must be approved by manager\n- Receipts required\n- Day passes OK, monthly membership OK\n\n### 4.7 Client Entertainment\n\n**Business meals with clients/prospects**:\n- Up to ¥15,000 per person (standard)\n- Up to ¥25,000 per person (executive-level)\n- Requires: Attendees, business purpose, receipts\n\n**Approval**:\n- <¥50,000 total: Manager\n- ≥¥50,000 total: VP Sales or CMO\n\n**See**: Sales and marketing guidelines\n\n### 4.8 Team Meals\n\n**Team building meals** (manager hosted):\n- Up to ¥5,000 per person\n- Quarterly or as appropriate\n- Manager approval\n- Entire team invited (no exclusions)\n\n**Not reimbursable**: Regular lunch with just 1-2 colleagues (personal expense)\n\n### 4.9 Office Supplies\n\n**Small purchases** for home office:\n- Pens, notebooks, sticky notes: Up to ¥5,000/month\n- Larger items: Request through IT/Facilities\n\n**Process**: Expense and attach receipt\n\n### 4.10 Software and Subscriptions\n\n**Business tools** (small):\n- <¥10,000/year: Expense with manager approval\n- ≥¥10,000/year: Submit procurement request\n\n**Examples**:\n- Grammarly (writing)\n- Notion (personal productivity)\n- ChatGPT Plus (work use)\n\n### 4.11 Parking and Tolls\n\n**When driving for business**:\n- Parking fees at client offices: Fully reimbursed\n- Toll charges: Fully reimbursed\n- Parking at home/office: Not reimbursed (personal choice to drive)\n\n### 4.12 Local Transportation\n\n**Business meetings** (not commuting):\n- Taxi: Reasonable when necessary\n- Train/bus: Fully reimbursed\n- IC card (Suica/Pasmo): Can expense business trips\n\n**Receipts**: Required for amounts >¥1,000\n\n---\n\n## 5. Non-Reimbursable Expenses\n\n### 5.1 Explicitly Not Covered\n\n- ❌ Commuting to regular office location\n- ❌ Personal meals (unless business travel)\n- ❌ Personal entertainment\n- ❌ Traffic fines and parking tickets\n- ❌ Personal grooming (haircuts, spa, gym)\n- ❌ Personal clothing (unless specific uniform required)\n- ❌ Childcare and family care\n- ❌ Lost or stolen personal items\n- ❌ Personal legal fees\n- ❌ Pet care\n- ❌ Personal health and wellness (covered by benefits)\n\n### 5.2 Gray Areas (Ask Before Expensing)\n\n**Potentially reimbursable with justification**:\n- Business attire for client-facing role\n- Ergonomic equipment beyond standard\n- Premium software tools\n- Large client gifts\n\n**Process**: Request pre-approval from manager + finance\n\n---\n\n## 6. Documentation Requirements\n\n### 6.1 Required Information\n\n**Every expense must include**:\n- ☐ Itemized receipt (photo acceptable)\n- ☐ Business purpose description\n- ☐ Date of expense\n- ☐ Amount (with currency if foreign)\n- ☐ Category (from approved list)\n- ☐ Attendees (for meals/entertainment)\n\n### 6.2 Receipt Requirements\n\n**Acceptable receipts**:\n- ✓ Itemized receipt showing detail\n- ✓ Photo of paper receipt\n- ✓ PDF email receipt\n- ✓ Digital receipt (from app)\n\n**Not acceptable**:\n- ❌ Credit card statement only (not itemized)\n- ❌ Handwritten notes\n- ❌ Receipts with faded ink (make copy immediately!)\n\n### 6.3 Lost Receipt Procedure\n\n**If receipt genuinely lost**:\n1. Submit expense with explanation\n2. Manager approval required\n3. Finance may request additional verification\n4. Limit: 3 lost receipts per year (pattern indicates carelessness)\n\n### 6.4 Foreign Currency\n\n**For international expenses**:\n- Include original currency amount\n- Conversion rate (use company credit card rate, or xe.com)\n- Screenshot of exchange rate\n- Will reimburse in JPY equivalent\n\n---\n\n## 7. Expense Submission Process\n\n### 7.1 Submission Timeline\n\n**Submit within 30 days** of expense\n\n**Late submissions**:\n- 30-60 days: Warning\n- 60-90 days: Requires VP approval\n- >90 days: Not reimbursed (policy violation)\n\n**Rationale**: Timely submission for accurate accounting and tax\n\n### 7.2 Submission Method\n\n**Via expense system** (Expensify):\n1. Log into Expensify\n2. Upload receipt (photo or PDF)\n3. Select category\n4. Enter amount and description\n5. Submit report\n6. Route to manager for approval\n\n**Mobile app**: Available for iOS and Android (preferred method)\n\n### 7.3 Manager Approval\n\n**Manager reviews**:\n- Business purpose appropriate\n- Amount reasonable\n- Receipt provided\n- Policy compliant\n\n**Approval timeline**: 3 business days\n\n**If denied**: Manager explains reason, employee can revise or appeal\n\n### 7.4 Finance Review\n\n**Finance checks**:\n- Manager approved\n- Receipts complete\n- Accounting codes correct\n- Policy compliant\n- No fraud indicators\n\n**Approval timeline**: 2 business days\n\n---\n\n## 8. Reimbursement Payment\n\n### 8.1 Payment Method\n\n**Reimbursement via**:\n- Bank transfer to registered account\n- Or payroll (next pay period)\n\n**Employee chooses** method in expense system\n\n### 8.2 Payment Timeline\n\n**Standard**: 15 business days from submission\n\n**Breakdown**:\n- Manager approval: 3 days\n- Finance review: 2 days\n- Payment processing: 10 days\n\n**Delays**: If additional information needed, timeline resets\n\n### 8.3 Payment Confirmation\n\n**Notification** when:\n- Expense approved\n- Payment processed\n- Funds transferred\n\n**Check**: Bank account or next paycheck\n\n---\n\n## 9. Corporate Credit Cards\n\n### 9.1 Eligibility\n\n**Corporate cards issued to**:\n- Employees with frequent expenses (>¥50K/month)\n- Directors and above\n- Sales and marketing team\n- Others by exception\n\n**Application**: Via finance team\n\n### 9.2 Corporate Card Usage\n\n**Advantages**:\n- No personal funds out-of-pocket\n- Automatic import to expense system\n- Better foreign exchange rates\n- Purchase protec\n\n[Content truncated due to length...]', category: 'Finance'});
